## 🔍 How to Search & Lookup

1. Open `Context/Topics.md` and find relevant keyword tags (e.g., `#KMP`, `#Architecture`).
2. Identify the mapped Chat IDs.
3. Scan `Chronicle/chat_log.md` (or `ActivityHistory/ChatLog.md`) for semantic TL;DR summaries.
4. Load only the specific transcript needed from `Chronicle/chat_files/<ID>.md` to prevent context bloat.
5. Incorporate historical truth and cite the source ID explicitly in your reasoning (e.g., *"Based on AG012..."*).

